link:footnoteLink.link:footnote:
The Employee Compensation Committee (ECC) of the Board of Directors of the Company, in its meeting held on 16.03.2024:-
1. Noted the forfeiture of 4750 options granted earlier under "Steel Strips Wheels Limited- Employees Stock Option Scheme, 2021" (ESOS 2021), as the employees to whom these options were granted have left the company;
2. Noted the forfeiture of all the outstanding 17500 vested stock options granted under "Steel Strips Wheels Limited- Employees Stock Option Scheme, 2016" (ESOS 2016), as the employees to whom these options were granted have left the company.
